<title>UK: Norway's Ekofisk crude to load 34 cargoes in May.</title>
<headline>Norway's Ekofisk crude to load 34 cargoes in May.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Ekofisk crude oil pipeline system is to load 34 cargoes in May, up one from April, trade sources said on Monday.</p>
<p>The May programme will consist of 13 cargoes of 600,000 barrels, 20 cargoes of 500,000 barrels and one cargo of 550,000 barrels.</p>
<p>A total of 18.9 million barrels are scheduled to load in May, up from 17.6 million barrels in April.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7930</p>
</text>
